<translate>
==== RackAfterShoot ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Parameter for weapons. If the parameter is true, then after the shot the player will reload the weapon.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
RackAfterShoot = true,
</syntaxhighlight>
